@subsection windows Windows 


@subsection windows_dep Installing Dependencies 


This section targets the users that need to use windows to run DDqt. In order to do that, the first step is to download and install visual studio 2022, cmake, vtk and qt for windows. 


• vs community 2022 (https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/) 


• cmake-3.29.2-windows-x86 64.msi (https://cmake.org/download/) 


